, one by one, into the melted chocolate mixture. Sieve over the flour and cocoa, and stir in. Stir in half the raspberries, scrape into the tray, then scatter over the remaining raspberries. Bake on the middle shelf for 30 mins or, if you prefer a firmer texture, for 5 mins more. Cool before slicing into squares. Store in an airtight container for up to 3 days."}]]}],["$","li","4",{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Cool Completely, Garnish & Serve"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Transfer Chocolate Raspberry Brownies to a wire cooling rack and let it cool for 15–20 minutes so the interior sets cleanly without crumbling. Lift out using the parchment overhang, garnish as desired, and slice into 4 portions."}]]}]]}],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","dubai-brownies",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/recipes/dubai-pistachio-brownies/","children":"Giant Stuffed Dubai Pistachio & Kataifi Brownies"}]}],["$","li","nutella-lava-skillet",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/recipes/molten-nutella-lava-cookie-skillet/","children":"Molten Nutella Lava Cookie Skillet"}]}],["$","li","viral-6",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/recipes/3-ingredient-brazilian-brigadeiro-truffles/","children":"3-Ingredient Brazilian Brigadeiro Truffles"}]}],["$","li","viral-12",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/recipes/10-min-air-fryer-s-mores-lava-dip/","children":"10-Min Air Fryer S'mores Lava Dip"}]}],["$","li","viral-13",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/recipes/60-second-molten-lava-chocolate-cake/","children":"60-Second Molten Lava Chocolate Cake"}]}],["$","li","mdb-53279",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/recipes/baklava-with-spiced-nuts-ricotta-chocolate/","children":"Baklava with spiced nuts, ricotta & chocolate"}]}]]}]]}]}]
